Date: Tue, 24 Nov 2026 23:15:37 +0200
Subject: Do not install Wi-Fi/BT tools

Luckfox Lyra has no Wi-Fi/BT chip. Dropping rkwifibt-app also drops
bluez5-utils, bluez-alsa and wpa_supplicant it selects.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 configs/rockchip_rk3506_luckfox_defconfig | 1 -
 1 file changed, 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/configs/rockchip_rk3506_luckfox_defconfig b/configs/rockchip_rk3506_luckfox_defconfig
index 43a5b079..ee6c71af 100644
--- a/configs/rockchip_rk3506_luckfox_defconfig
+++ b/configs/rockchip_rk3506_luckfox_defconfig
@@ -68,7 +68,6 @@ BR2_PACKAGE_RKADK=y
 BR2_PACKAGE_RKADK_DISPLAY=y
 BR2_PACKAGE_RKADK_EXAMPLES=y
 BR2_PACKAGE_RKADK_PLAYER=y
-BR2_PACKAGE_RKWIFIBT_APP=y
 BR2_PACKAGE_ROCKCHIP_RGA=y
 BR2_PACKAGE_ROCKCHIP_TEST=y
 BR2_PACKAGE_TCPDUMP=y
